{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月10日，Google宣佈將其最新人工智能模型 Gemini 4 Carbon 向公眾全面開放。就在兩周前，該模型還只向一小批「網絡安全防禦人員」提供。Google稱，Carbon 是迄今「最強的模型」，有能力與 Anthropic 和 OpenAI 最頂尖的系統一較高下。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585832.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T17:24:28.527306+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T16:58:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T17:17:46.380544+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T17:17:46.380544+00:00","content_hash":"cd41ecb9e1e84c5be519ffdf987a2e3a2a136e319d660cfbeb2dd5f566fdccba","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}